1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,796
The Intruders: three masked strangers who believe they're doing holy work, one home

2
00:00:04,796 --> 00:00:05,825
invasion at a time.

3
00:00:06,045 --> 00:00:07,325
Here's how they play.

4
00:00:08,133 --> 00:00:12,363
Place all three Killer meeples, Trish in red, Zeke in black and Baghead in grey, on

5
00:00:12,363 --> 00:00:14,555
the Killer start space from the Setup card.

6
00:00:14,775 --> 00:00:18,504
Give each one their starting health and their own Final Health token, and put the

7
00:00:18,504 --> 00:00:21,175
Active Killer token on Trish's circle on the Killer board.

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,643
The Intruders are three Killers, but only one is active at any moment:

9
00:00:25,643 --> 00:00:27,568
the one with the Active Killer token.

10
00:00:27,788 --> 00:00:32,025
Only the Active Killer resolves move and attack icons, and only it gets placed when

11
00:00:32,025 --> 00:00:33,505
a card says place the Killer.

12
00:00:34,333 --> 00:00:36,509
The Active Killer changes in three ways.

13
00:00:36,729 --> 00:00:40,564
One: when you attack a Killer, whether you damage it or not, or use an Item to

14
00:00:40,564 --> 00:00:43,023
damage it, that Killer becomes Active immediately.

15
00:00:43,243 --> 00:00:47,478
Two: the Up and Down icons on cards move the token to the next Killer up or down the

16
00:00:47,478 --> 00:00:50,453
board. It wraps from top to bottom, and skips dead Killers.

17
00:00:50,673 --> 00:00:54,692
Three: when the Active Killer is killed, the token moves to the top-most Killer

18
00:00:54,692 --> 00:00:55,303
still alive.

19
00:00:56,133 --> 00:00:58,466
When a card says All Killers, ignore the token:

20
00:00:58,466 --> 00:01:02,090
resolve it for the top Killer on the board, then each one below in order.

21
00:01:02,090 --> 00:01:03,728
The Active Killer doesn't change.

22
00:01:03,948 --> 00:01:08,116
In the Panic phase, Victims in a space with any Killer, not just the Active one,

23
00:01:08,116 --> 00:01:09,836
panic if a Victim died that turn.

24
00:01:10,056 --> 00:01:14,372
Minor Dark Powers apply to all three Killers, and damage to any Killer hits the

25
00:01:14,372 --> 00:01:15,901
Minor Dark Power card first.

26
00:01:16,733 --> 00:01:20,728
When a Killer that still has its black Final Health token loses its last health, and

27
00:01:20,728 --> 00:01:23,581
another Killer is still on the board, the phase doesn't end.

28
00:01:23,801 --> 00:01:27,285
Lay it on its side, change the Active Killer, and finish the phase.

29
00:01:27,285 --> 00:01:30,249
Then reveal its black token. Blank means it's truly dead:

30
00:01:30,249 --> 00:01:34,253
remove it. Health means it stands back up with that health, and a white token

31
00:01:34,253 --> 00:01:35,449
replaces the black one.

32
00:01:35,669 --> 00:01:39,663
You get the plus-one Adrenaline die only once, however many are on their Final

33
00:01:39,663 --> 00:01:40,021
Health.

34
00:01:40,833 --> 00:01:43,859
Here's the rulebook example. Ginny shoots Trish for three:

35
00:01:43,859 --> 00:01:46,103
Trish becomes Active, with one health left.

36
00:01:46,323 --> 00:01:50,259
In the Killer phase, Trish attacks; Ginny Retaliates and hits her for one.

37
00:01:50,259 --> 00:01:54,302
Trish is laid on her side and the token moves to the top-most living Killer,

38
00:01:54,302 --> 00:01:54,728
Baghead.

39
00:01:54,948 --> 00:01:59,294
The Terror card says Baghead acts, then the token moves up, skipping Trish, to Zeke,

40
00:01:59,294 --> 00:02:03,382
who acts, then up again to Baghead. After the phase, Trish's token is revealed:

41
00:02:03,382 --> 00:02:04,313
blank. She's dead.

42
00:02:05,133 --> 00:02:09,401
Maskaphobia: once a turn, when a Killer moves into your space, raise Horror by one,

43
00:02:09,401 --> 00:02:12,024
and you can't buy Focus while a Killer is with you.

44
00:02:12,244 --> 00:02:16,611
No Remorse: roll a die each Upkeep; if it beats the number of Killers left, raise

45
00:02:16,611 --> 00:02:20,925
Bloodlust. Strength in Numbers: each attack does an extra damage for every other

46
00:02:20,925 --> 00:02:23,081
Killer in the same or an adjacent space.

47
00:02:23,301 --> 00:02:25,420
And the Epic Dark Power, Won't Stay Down:

48
00:02:25,420 --> 00:02:29,709
the first Killer to die immediately gets two health and a random black Final Health

49
00:02:29,709 --> 00:02:30,277
token back.

50
00:02:31,100 --> 00:02:35,459
Their Finales add pressure. You're Gonna Die has the Active Killer attack, then the

51
00:02:35,459 --> 00:02:39,292
next one down attacks too. Hunt Sweet Hunt adds a damage to every attack.

52
00:02:39,512 --> 00:02:43,690
Release the Beast makes all Killers Active for the rest of the game, acting from the

53
00:02:43,690 --> 00:02:47,619
top down. And the Epic Finale has every Killer attack the moment it's revealed.

54
00:02:48,433 --> 00:02:52,397
A few tips. Attacking a Killer makes it Active, so you can choose who comes for you

55
00:02:52,397 --> 00:02:52,636
next.

56
00:02:52,856 --> 00:02:57,037
Focus on finishing one Killer at a time, and avoid standing near two at once.

57
00:02:57,257 --> 00:03:00,747
Every Killer you remove before the Finale makes it far less deadly.

58
00:03:00,747 --> 00:03:01,268
Good luck.

